window.products.push({"id":516078,"name":"MDPLY Vintage Rose Flower Hook Wall Mounted Wall Decor Durable Handmade Resin Decorative Robe Hook, Scarf, Bag, Towel, Hat etc for Kitchen Bathroom Of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EZCYyst0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Specifications: Material: Resin and metal Style:  Gold Rose ----- Size: 4.2 x 2.4 inch (Approx.) Max weight capacity: 10 lb (4.5 KG). Feature: small, cute and convenient Package Content: 1 x  Hook 1 set of expansion screws Hook Feature: ❤ Made of premium resin material, warm texture. ❤ Multiple useful occasion, apply to kitchen, bathroom, living room, garden, closet, balcony, add a special look to your home. ❤ Hooks perfectly for clothing, coat, hat, handbag, towel, keys, basket, mini potted plants and other hanging items storaging. ❤ A nice gift, the pretty hanging hook can go well with vintage, modern and many other room themes. How to Installation ？ Step 1: Mark where you want to place your coat hooks Step 2: Drill where the mark is. Step 3: Tighten the screws in place, and you’re done! Notes: There will be slight paint unevenness, excessive color, spots, scratches, etc., which are unavoidable, but will not affect the overall effect. Due to the different monitor and light effect, the actual color of the item might be slightly different from the color showed on the pictures. Thank you! Please allow 1-2cm measuring deviation due to manual measurement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EZCYyst0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MDPLY","source_asin":"B09XDSTYJ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XDSTYJ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XDSTYJ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":516079,"name":"Ticoland Chorreador,Costa Rica Handmade Foldable Wooden Stand Coffee Maker,Included:1 Large+1 Medium Reusable Cloth Filters (Colador,Bolsa),Model:El P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yVkVrbRWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Simple and easy to use: -Place the cloth filter inside the opening of the Chorreador. -Add your favorite coffee grind inside the cloth filter (Colador/Bolsa). -Pour over boiling water slowly, the amount of water added should be in accordance with the coffee strength you want to make. Cleaning and maintaining: -Rinse the cloth filter in warm water after each use. -Allow the cloth filter to dry between uses, or save it in a plastic bag inside the refrigerator when it is not used for extended periods of time. Warning: (Do not) use any kind of soap or detergent to clean the cloth filter, because it will leave undesirable taste in the cloth material which will be transferred to the brewed coffee as well. Alternatively you can clean the cloth filter by rubbing it in salt and rinsing it in warm water every once in a while. Note: It is normal for the cloth filter to get stained and change its color to dark brown after a few uses due to the oils that get released from the coffee grinds during the brewing process, That will not affect the function of the cloth filter nor the taste of the brewed coffee in any negative way. On the contrary, traditionally it's believed that the longer a cloth filter has been used for to brew coffee the better the taste of the coffee will get. Included cloth filters (Colador/Bolsa) Size: Large: 7\"x4\"x0.25\", Medium: 6\"x3.5\"x0.2” Cloth filter wooden handle length : 2” (5cm)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yVkVrbRWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tico Land","source_asin":"B013HMTJYA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013HMTJYA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013HMTJYA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":516080,"name":"Synhozz Premium Blue Velvet Hangers with Tie Bar Rose Gold Hook, Non Slip Clothes Hangers,Huggable Hangers Coat Suit Hangers, Felt Hangers, Slimline H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710oq3rQ52L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPACE SAVING:Designed blue velvet hangers Increases Closet space by as much as 50 percent.They're designed with notched shoulders to hang belts, ties, shawls, thin strap shirts, and tank tops. NON SLIP: These hangers are perfect for keeping your clothes looking great. The velvet coating on these hangers provides non-slip protection for garments. These hangers are elegant and functional. The velvet coating helps keep clothes from slipping off, and the hooks are designed to hang from racks easily. SWIVEL ROSE GOLD HOOKS: The SYNHOZZ velvet hangers are designed with a swivel hook that can rotate 360 degrees. This makes it easy to sort clothes no matter which direction they are facing. HEAVY DUTY: These blue velvet hangers are made of high-quality ABS plastic and are 17.5 x 0.2 x 9 inches. They are durable and sturdy, and can hold clothes of up to 18 pounds. They are stronger and lighter than wooden hangers, but much more expensive. SLOP-FREE DESIGN: The specially developed shoulder line is added to promise worry-free preservation of the clothing's shape. There are grooves on each shoulder that can be used to hang clothes with thin shoulder straps, great without slipping off tightly for your tank tops, dresses, bras, ties, belts, nightgowns, shawls, and skirts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710oq3rQ52L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SYNHOZZ","source_asin":"B09MNJ6HHH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MNJ6HHH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MNJ6HHH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
