window.products.push({"id":516155,"name":"Santa Figure Collection 14\", Handcrafted Standing Santa Claus in Camisa Handwoven Philippine Buri with Filipino Parol Star Lantern Ornament to Light B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jKgjdHqUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This standing Santa Claus is exclusively designed for the GUTZ Collection. It is not mass produced but instead is handcrafted by a single artist in his home north of Manila so annual production is limited. It is inspired by the long festive Philippine Christmas celebration starting around October each year. In this design, Santa wears traditional informal Filipino Camisa de Chino work wear and handwoven buri hat. In his hand, he holds a miniature replica of a Parol star lantern which is one of the Philippine cultural symbol for the Christmas Holiday. The Parol is handcrafted from sustainable ecofriendly capiz shell pounded into this accent decor after harvesting the shellfish from tropical waters for food. Santa shows off his jolly grin behind his white beard and mustache. He is happy to be delivering gifts from his burlap sack decorated with Christmas ornaments and natural pinecone. This figure can be home decor for celebrating Philippine Christmas traditions, given as a gift honoring Filipino culture and heritage, or kept as a souvenir of a trip to the tropical islands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jKgjdHqUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GUTZ","source_asin":"B081YF2GR6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081YF2GR6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081YF2GR6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
