window.products.push({"id":516172,"name":"Christmas Snowflake Window Cling Stickers White Snowflake Window Decals-Snowflake Window Clings for Santa Reindeer Christmas Window Clings Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SU7vQ7PdL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"CUTE DESIGNS Great Christmas snowflake window cling stickers Christmas snowflake window cling stickers are very cute and full of joy. Their colors are very bright,and filled with a happy smile. When you put these white snowflake window decals on the window, you will get festive Christmas white snowflakes window cling decorations and children will love the cute snowflakes window decals. These white snowflake window clings will be a joy to them as well as a wonderful part of their Christmas traditions. GREAT GIFT Great gift for kids. Multiple usage scenarios Our Christmas snowflake window cling stickers are suitable for use in children's rooms, classrooms or offices. You can decorate kitchen windows, bathroom mirrors, sliding glass doors and even refrigerators,to add the Christmas atmosphere! EASY TO USE Easy to use Our white snowflake window decals is glueless.Before sticking Christmas window clings to windows and glass, make sure the surface is clean and smooth. Just spray some water on smooth surfaces such as mirrors, windows and refrigerators, and easily clean Christmas snowflake window cling stickers with a wet towel.No residue will not damage the window. PACKAGE INCLUDES Package includes Contains 8 white snowflake window decals made of environmentally friendly PVC materials. 331 pieces in total.Includes 4 stickers full of snowflakes, 2 very cute Santa Claus stickers,and 2 smiling elk stickers.Double-sided design, can be moved and reused,which means you can watch the Christmas snowflake window clings from indoors and outdoors, allowing smiling reindeer and Santa Claus to add fun to your holiday.The snowflakes window decals size of each sheet is 11.4x8.3inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SU7vQ7PdL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ergou Youth","source_asin":"B09DYRBVK5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516172","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DYRBVK5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DYRBVK5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":516173,"name":"PANDICORN Set of 4 St Patricks Day Pillow Covers 18x18 for St Patricks Day Decorations, St. Patricks Pattys Day Green Shamrock Lucy Leprechaun, St Pat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718PfgcYfXL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"BRING THE LUCK OF THE IRISH TO YOUR HOME DECOR WITH OUR GREEN ST PATRICKS DAY PILLOWS COVERS. Whether you’re hosting a St Patricks Day party or just to show your Irish pride, celebrate this popular holiday with our St. Patricks Day decor throw pillow covers that will turn everyone who sees it green with envy!● You’ll love the the St. Patrick’s-inspired flair of this spring pillow covers 18x18 when you’re decorating your home.  ● The green decor throw pillows covers add a farmhouse holiday appeal for your couch, sofa, bed, front door chair, and outdoor garden porch bench.  ● Our 4 pack rustic black and cream pillow cases easily complement any home decor, from modern, rustic to country, vintage and completed the spring vibe.  ● This bright throw pillow covers set is the perfect pick for both spring St. Patrick’s style and warm comfort.  ● The perfect Irish/housewarming/ holiday gifts that’s sure to leave everyone smile.   Product details: ● Material: 100% Linen-Polyester Blends.  ● Size: 18x18 inches/45x45 cm  ● Closure: Smoothly concealed zipper for an easy removal ● Package included: 4 Pc Faux Burlap Black and Cream St. Patrick’s Theme Decorative Throw Pillows Covers, WITHOUT Pillow Insert.  Care Instructions: ● Wash in cold water at gentle cycle.  ● Iron at medium temperature.  ● Do not bleach.  ● Dry flat or hang to dry.  Please Note: ● Pillow insert is NOT INCLUDED. PILLOW COVER ONLY. ● The colors may vary slightly depending on computer screen settings. ● The printed pattern of faux linen throw pillow cover is available on FRONT side ONLY, back is solid light linen color WITHOUT printing. ● To ensure a snug fit and plumper looking pillow, all covers are sewn approx. 1/2 inch (1.3cm) smaller than actual size of pillow, which is the industrial standard.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718PfgcYfXL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PANDICORN","source_asin":"B08QGYLGRR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QGYLGRR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QGYLGRR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":516174,"name":"Guzzini Vintage 10-1/2-Inch L Two Tone Serving Spoon, Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HlekOCJKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Founded in 1912, Fratelli Guzzini introduced Plexiglas to the domestic landscape in 1938, at a time when household objects were still strongly tied to the more traditional materials of wood, glass and iron. Continuous innovation in the following decades led to the development of the Guzzini style. With an exciting approach to color and materials, Guzzini plays a large part in what the world recognizes as the Italian look. Guzzini is still a family-run business, and is one of the leading designers and manufacturers of kitchenware. The best names in international design choose to work with Guzzini due to the company's ability to combine quality and beauty. Guzinni has received the prestigious Compasso d'Oro award in recognition of the company's commitment to design. Re-editing the original shape of the 50's updated with an innovative technologic process, the Vintage collection is determined by two layers of material : a solid white one inside and a clear colorful one outside, for a perfect, emotional blend of aesthetic and functionality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HlekOCJKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Guzzini","source_asin":"B0056G9ZHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516174","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0056G9ZHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0056G9ZHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
