window.products.push({"id":516190,"name":"Popsicle Molds, ONIPU Ice Pop Molds Set, Reusable 6-Compartment Easy-Releasestorage Popsicle Ice Molds, Storage Container for Homemade Food, Kids Ice ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EWyAgW7sS._AC_SL1082_.jpg","description":"[SAFE TO USE] ONIPU popsicle molds are made of durable high-quality pp material, and children can safely make their own popsicle molds. Homemade popsicles will not have any weird things like adding fake colors, chemicals or spices. The childlike rabbit ear handle and rounded corners are designed without burrs to prevent scratches. You and your children can make homemade popsicles at will and enjoy a happy DIY time together. [6 ICE POP POPSICLE MOLD SET] Each package can hold 6 molds. The mold placed in the box can be easily transported to the refrigerator. The whole set of equipment can be stored well without taking up a lot of cabinet space in the refrigerator. And the design of the reusable popsicle mold is easy to use and clean, please feel free to use it. [PLEASE NOTE] After taking out the frozen ice ball from the refrigerator, please do not pull out the ice cream immediately! Please leave them for 2-3 minutes. It is recommended to put them in hot water for a few seconds or rinse them in cold water for a minute, then the ice cream will come out easily. In this way, it is not easy to damage the mold and keep the ice lollies intact. [MAKE IT WHATEVER YOU WANT] Our reusable popsicle molds are specially designed to freeze juice and other ingredients into perfect popsicles. You can use juice, puree, yogurt, fruit, pudding, jam and jelly to make your own unique frozen snacks. Every kind of frozen food can perfectly satisfy the taste of your family. This is a great gift for your friends or children. This mold allows you to freely choose a variety of delicious dishes and enjoy them anytime, anywhere. [WHY CHOOSE US] The length of the sticks is moderate, and children can easily taste the whole delicacy; the capacity of each grid is just right, and it will not cause waste. It is our mission to provide excellent products and services to every customer. If you have any questions about our ice hockey mold, please feel free to contact us, we will provide you with a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EWyAgW7sS._AC_SL1082_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ONIPU","source_asin":"B092V7Q5ZB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092V7Q5ZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092V7Q5ZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
