window.products.push({"id":516202,"name":"Valuxhome Electric Fireplace, 72 Inches Wall Mounted Fireplace with Overheating Protection, Thermostat, Timer & Remote, Log & Crystal, Touch Screen, 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":609.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f6ttz6CHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"SPECIFICATION: The overall dimension is 72\"L X 5\"D X 18.35\"H; this fireplace provides supplemental heating for a room up to 400sq ft; 5120 BTUS; the room will be warm in a few minutes, 6ft power cable, uses 120V AC WALL MOUNTED INSTALLATION: the wall fireplace is designed for wall mounted installation only which is easy to install and uninstall, the bracket for wall mount available, it will be installed in an hour TWO FUEL BED OPTIONS AND MULTI FLAME MODES: This wall mounted fireplace comes with faux fire logs and crystals that resembles burning coals, creating an authentic feel & look of a traditional fireplace & bring interesting DIY assembly. This liner fireplace electric offers 3 flame colors & 3 fuel bed colors to match up to your preference THERMOSTAT & TIMER CONTROL: The fireplace can operated with or without heat; With heat, its heating level(750w/1500w)& temperature(62℉ to 86℉) can be adjusted. When fireplace heater is powered on, the motion of the fan is very smooth, the noise is low and surface of the fireplace is not hot. A built-in timer for auto-shut off can be set for 1H to 9H. The wall mount fireplace electric with remote and touch screen help you control the heater more convinient MODERN HOME DECOR AND SAFE DESIGN: The sleek contemporary linear fireplace heaters for indoor use are perfectly installed in living room, entertainment center, corner, bedroom, condo, dining room and loft as a decorative fireplace with no heat for year-round ambience. The fireplace electric has LED technology without gas or oil. It's overheat protection would cut-off the device when the heater is overheating. 1 year warranty and lifetime support by Valuxhome","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f6ttz6CHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Valuxhome","source_asin":"B09P1D1JSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516202","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P1D1JSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P1D1JSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
