window.products.push({"id":516236,"name":"Personalized Travel Ornaments 2022 – Polyresin Travel Suitcase Ornament – Around The World Ornaments for Travelers, Travel Decorations – Vacation Chri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lgxAZI94L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Travel Christmas Ornaments – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our Christmas vacation ornament is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and elegant details of a travel suitcase. This Christmas, remember your great adventures around the world and share them with your friends and family with this special world traveler ornament! Expert Artist Personalization – Other personalized travelers ornaments often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. Every travel decor 2022 is delicately hand painted to ensure its unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND travel ornament for Christmas tree you’ll always cherish. Celebrate Life’s Biggest Moments – Cherish your favorite memories and commemorate those incredible vacations and special moments spent with your loved ones that you want to remember most. Crafted with festive details and vibrant colors and personalized to your specifications, your unique Christmas vacation ornaments and travel party decorations will make your Christmas tree feel extra special and unique to your family home. This season, give the gift of joy! 24-Hour Order Processing – Our travel decorations for home make beautiful travel gifts for men and women, travel theme party decorations and Christmas vacation gifts to cherish every holiday season. Your travel ornament will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a Gift Box, Gift Bag and Gift Tag – no need for wrapping! The perfect gifts for families, friends and all frequent travelers in your life to create loving and lasting memories that will surely be cherished forever! Happy Travelers – At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful travel theme gifts and travel the world decorations for families to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 custom tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship. If for any reason you don’t love your travel theme decor 2022, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lgxAZI94L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B0BNJ3FJKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNJ3FJKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNJ3FJKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
