window.products.push({"id":516254,"name":"Max & Lily Low Loft Bed, Twin Bed Frame For Kids With Slide and Curtains For Bottom, White/Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Y1wrzN3dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Low Loft + Slide : Now that’s a win-win! The Max & Lily Low Twin Loft Bed with Slide & Blue Curtains is the perfect combination of functional and fun that both kids and parents love. Only 50 inches high, this space-saving low loft design is great for smaller spaces and safe for younger children. Top bed features tall 14” guardrails, so the bed safely fits standard mattress sizes. A super fun slide is perfect for playtimes. Angled ladder with rounded edges offers comfortable, easy climbing. Added bonus - the ladder and slide are both reversible and removable, so they are flexible to work with any space. Solid, knot-free New Zealand pine wood adds strength and stability. All Max & Lily products use a durable, low VOC finish. The slatted head and footboards and flush, color-matched hardware give this low loft bed a clean, modern look. Instructions, slat roll, and required hardware are included. With solid plywood slats and a metal under-bed support bar, this sleeping surface can support 400 pounds of resting weight. 2+ adults makes assembly simple and easy. This bed meets or exceeds Federal safety standards for kids furniture. When it’s time for play, this low loft bed’s space saving design frees up plenty of floor space. 100% cotton play curtains add even more fun to your room. The Twin Low Loft Bed with Slide & Blue Curtains from Max & Lily offers exceptional quality and affordability that kids and their parents will enjoy for years to come. Max & Lily is a member of the Maxwood family of brands - the kids furniture experts bringing a tradition of superior quality, safety and fun! THIS PRODUCT IS INTENDED FOR USE BY CHILDREN AGE 6-10 YEARS OLD. To prevent serious injury, children must NOT use the slide until properly installed. Observing the following statements and warnings reduces the likelihood of serious or fatal injury. ONLY 1 user/occupant of the slide at a time, weighing no more than 106 lbs (48 kg). It is strongly recommended that there be on-site adult supervision for children. Please instruct children not to walk in front of children sliding down the slide. Please instruct children not to use the equipment in a manner other than intended. Do not attach items to the bed or slide that are not specifically designed for use with it, such as, but not limited to, jump ropes, clothes lines, pet leashes, cables and chain as they may cause a strangulation hazard. WE STRONGLY RECOMMENDED TO PLACE THE SLIDE ON A LEVEL SURFACE AT A SAFE DISTANCE FROM ANY STRUCTURE OR OBSTRUCTION SUCH AS A WALL, FURNITURE ETC","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Y1wrzN3dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Max & Lily","source_asin":"B0B3NJK25B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3NJK25B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3NJK25B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
