window.products.push({"id":516346,"name":"Wise Bird Chinese Japanese Folding Hand Fan for women, Summer Cooling Accessories Vintage Retro Style 8\" Bamboo Wood Silk Pocket Purse Fan for Wedding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81irR+jZr5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About the Design This simple yet elegant bamboo hand painting design fan is strong and durable for daily use, and can also make a beautiful home accent when displayed. It is made from semi-transparent silk and handle. When folded it's compact and portable, and easily tucks away in a purse or bag. About the Hand Fan The folding hand fan is recognized as being invented in Japan or China with both countries holding legends of its creation. In Japan the fan is thought to be modeled after the folding wings of a bat, while the Chinese believe the sight of a woman fanning her face mask at a festival led to the tool's creation. The device was taken to Europe in the 1500s by way of trade routes and became an exotic and stylish symbol of wealth and class. Silk fans made out of very delicate transparent silk on well polished bamboo. These fans have Asian designs of flowers, birds, and plants. Great Ideas about Hand Fan Sweet, elegant gifts to all women  Protection against rain  For theater or dance programs Creat breeze in hot weather  Match traditional Asian themed costume/cosplay outfits  Make wedding or party memorable by keeping guests cool of immediate use  Stylish business gifts Interior decoration for house, hotel or restaurant Accessories Hand made silk pouches in protecting or wrapping the fan. Elegant tassel. Other Notes As with all handcrafted work, Each fan is handmade of silk and bamboo and may look slightly different from photo. Dimensions 8.25\" x 15\" when open 8.25\" long when folded Handmade in China. Product is made by skilled fan workers. Child Labor Free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81irR+jZr5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wise Bird","source_asin":"B01G5P20VA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516346","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01G5P20VA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01G5P20VA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
