window.products.push({"id":516377,"name":"3 Piece Rustic Farmhouse Blue Mason Jar Bathroom Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+y+HMrLlL.jpg","description":"This Set of three beautiful blue mason Jars with bronze lid rings includes is one quart jar, one standard mouth pint jar with bronze soap dispenser, and one wide mouth pint jar. The jars have been painted in two layers of gorgeous blue over a gray base coat then distressed. The jars have been sealed with a matte spray sealer. The final look is a so pretty! It reminds me of those favorite faded jeans with the holes in the knees we all have! The neck of each jar is wrapped in jute twine tied with a knot. This set would look amazing with many decor styles...rustic, cottage, farmhouse, shabby chic and more! Please message me with any questions!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+y+HMrLlL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B079KSNJ6N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079KSNJ6N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079KSNJ6N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":516378,"name":"AN-1011 Kitchen knife 4-Pcs set damascus steel blade.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":115.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FxhhWTC9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The High Grade Damascus steel used for these blades consists of layers of low carbon & high carbon (1095&15N20) mixture welded, forged and hammered several times to obtain Up to 200 Layers. The hardness of these blades is up to 56 to 58 HRC on the Rockwell scale providing sharp edges that are designed for lots of use. Precision heat treating methods are employed to provide the sharpest, most enduring edges available. Only quality materials have been used to create this beautiful Knife. For the collectors this knife is stylish and built to last. How to care for your new knives: ~ Store in a dry place, moisture encourages rust. Damascus is very easy to clean if rusted but is rust resistant. ~ After use, wash and dry the blade & apply vegetable oil, or any food safe lubricating oil. ~ Sometimes Damascus steel darkens with age. To brighten up the blade, sand it lengthwise with a worn piece of sand paper. This just hits the raised portions of the etched pattern and makes the blade look brighter. No two items are ever identical; the item you receive may be slightly different to the pictures shown. Damascus steel is a refined method of forging steel where the anvil and the hammer determine just what kind of knife is made each time. The use of natural materials i.e., buffalo horn, stag horn, wood and camel bone means that variations in color and slight imperfections may be present but make each knife that much more unique.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FxhhWTC9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HNS","source_asin":"B01NAVO1R0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516378","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NAVO1R0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NAVO1R0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
