window.products.push({"id":516605,"name":"Moonspell Logo And Moongrams Super Strip 7 7/8 Inch Heavy Metal Music Band Woven Applique Patch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JF8ERPj9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Welcome To The Kimje Shop Why Choose Our Meat Thermometer ✓Instant read meat thermometer has the function of timing alarm. You can set a satisfactory barbecue temperature and wait for its arrival. It allows you to go to other cuisines without any worries. Practical Design: 1.The folding probe is locked in place to ensure cleanliness and safety.2.Automatically shut down after 10 minutes, energy saving and environmental protection design.3.The ultra-clear LCD screen allows you to see it clearly during the day or night, and it is a practical and simple design. Easy To Use Press once to turn the indicator on or off. Press and hold for 2 seconds to choose between Celsius and Fahrenheit, your preference is within your range. Note: (1) The body must be placed outside the oven, grill, and smoker.(2) The wire probe and the original probe cannot be used together. When using a wire probe, retract and lock the original probe. Calibration And Hold Function: ake a glass of ice water filled with ice cubes, insert the probe into the cup, making sure that its tip contacts the ice cubes underwater. After obtaining the final temperature of the ice water, press and hold the \"CAL\" key for 5 seconds until \"CAL\" flashes on the display. The number will then flash, allowing you to adjust the number to 0°C (32°F). Press the \"C/F\" button to increase the value, press the \"HOLD\" button to decrease the value. The number will continue to flash for 23 seconds, during which you should complete the adjustment of the number. Confirm your adjustment only when the number stops flashing, which means the calibration is complete. Do not remove the probe before the digits stop flashing, otherwise it may cause accuracy error. Please click the yellow button on the right to add to your shopping cart and start your barbecue journey immediately","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JF8ERPj9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kimje","source_asin":"B00B1U1818","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B1U1818","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B1U1818","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":516606,"name":"Makita XLC03R1BX4 18V LXT Lithium-Ion Compact Brushless Cordless Vacuum Kit, Trigger w/Lock (2.0Ah) and 191D72-1 Black Cyclonic Vacuum Attachment w/Lo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":331.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vp7zKip1L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The Makita® 18V LXT® Brushless cordless vacuum kit (XLC03R1BX4) is a compact and powerful cordless vacuum with strong suction for fast and efficient cleaning. The vacuum can be used with trigger mode or slide switch mode for ease and convenience. Compact and ergonomic design for operator comfort and, at 2.7 lbs., is lightweight for Reduced operator fatigue. A bagless cloth Filtration system allows for easier cleaning and quicker debris disposal. The vacuum and included nozzle and attachment feature the distinctive Teal and Black trade dress. The XLC03R1BX4 is a kit and includes one fast-charging 18V LXT 2.0Ah Lithium-Ion battery and efficient Rapid optimum charger. The powerful Makita-built motor delivers up to 49 CFM. It’s part of Makita’s expanding 18V LXT® system, the world’s largest cordless tool system powered by 18V Lithium-Ion batteries. Makita® 18V Lithium-Ion batteries have the fastest charge times in their categories, so they spend more time working and less time sitting on the charger. For improved tool performance and extended battery life, Makita created Star protection Computer controls™. Star protection is communication technology that allows the Star Protection-equipped tool and battery to exchange data in real time and monitor conditions during use to protect against overloading, over-discharging and overheating. For increased versatility, the tool can also be powered by Makita® 18V LXT® and compact Lithium-Ion batteries with the Star symbol on the battery indicating Star protection inside.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vp7zKip1L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Makita","source_asin":"B086Y18657","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086Y18657","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086Y18657","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
