window.products.push({"id":516667,"name":"Reusable Mesh Tote Bags - Organic Cotton Farmers Market Bags - Cute Mesh Grocery Shopping Bags with Reinforced Bottom - Net Mushroom Foraging Bags - K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tsPDs8tTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reduce – Reuse – Recycle Be a champion of the three “Rs” of waste management – Reduce, Reuse, Recycle! The three basic tenets of this waste hierarchy help us cut down on the amount of waste that gets thrown away. They help conserve natural resources, landfill space, and energy. With Organic Cotton Mart mesh bags, first you are reducing the amount of plastic (and paper) waste entering the environment, and then reusing your one-time purchase. And at the end of a bag’s life, it is 100% biodegradable and compostable. Versatile Multi-Purpose Bags Fall in love with the tons of awesome uses for these reusable mesh bags: Grocery bags Grocery bags Produce bags Produce bags Shopping bags Shopping bags Kitchen storage Kitchen storage Pool & beach tote Pool & beach tote Activity & day bag Activity & day bag Toy & knick-knack organizer Toy & knick-knack organizer You’ll love these bags so much they’ll quickly become your go-to for nearly any occasion! Lightweight and Compact Crafted from lightweight organic cotton fiber, our mesh bags are easy to roll up and keep tucked away – while taking up barely any storage space. Small enough when folded to keep available in your purse, backpack, or vehicle for whenever you need one. Extra Large Capacity Don’t let their small appearance fool you! These reusable storage bags are designed to stretch and expand, offering a generous amount of space to hold food, clothes, toys, household essentials, and other items. Cotton is lightweight, but our mesh design is guaranteed strong, durable, and resilient over time. Certified Organic Cotton Crafted from 100% high-quality organic cotton knit fabric with a certification for Ecology and Social Responsibility. Feel confident knowing you’re buying something truly environmentally and socially responsible – from organic raw materials, to ethical harvesting, to eco-conscious manufacturing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tsPDs8tTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Organic Cotton Mart","source_asin":"B07TZPB8L9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516667","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TZPB8L9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TZPB8L9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
