window.products.push({"id":516758,"name":"Mamba 1g 50mm Electric Herb Grinder. 6V Battery Powered One-Handed Mill. Easy Press Two-Direction Rocker Switch for Fluffy Product Grinding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bBq8dYT0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌿 A PINCH OF HERB: No matter how dense or oily, dispense your favorite herb product 8X faster than hand grinding. Gently ground but not mulched by 6V battery-powered sharp teeth. With a 50mm metal head that holds up to 1g and its simple one-handed use – get blasted into herb preparation! 🌿 BATTERY POWERED: Automatic grinder with four standard 1.5V AA batteries give 1Nm of turning torque to power the offset-curved razor sharp teeth, milled from aluminum alloy. Batteries not included 🌿IT GETS THE HARD WORK DONE: Electric herb grinder meets all your needs on grinding. Just alternate the Rocker Switch in both forward and reverse directions for texture and consistency, and also prevent jams or clogging. 🌿 LOAD–CLOSE–GRIND! Lay electric grinder flat and load-up to capacity, close, then grind and dispense for a medium to fine texture. Its clear-cone spout pours with no contamination or spillages of expensive product. Complete with cleaning pick tools NB. Not suitable for hard nuts, shells, pepper corns or beans 🌿 THE RIGHT GRIND – AT THE RIGHT TIME! The Mamba Team’s designs and testing has led to a Battery Grinder that unlocks your herb’s flavour, distinctive aroma, and potency - all at the push of a button. See the Mamba Team on-line by searching for our original electric herb grinder Kickstarter video","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bBq8dYT0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mamba","source_asin":"B07H3M9ZTQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H3M9ZTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H3M9ZTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
