window.products.push({"id":516776,"name":"Zareas Adult Weighted Blanket Queen Size（20lbs 60\"x80\", Cozy Fleece Cooling Heavy Blanket with Premium Glass Beads, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XGZhmwqYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material & Design: With cozy flannel on the top, thousands of small glass beads in the middle, and soft faux fleece at the back, this furry weighted blanket has 7 layers in total, designed to lock the beads firmly & evenly to provid the right amount of weight and warmth, and give you great tough feeling at the same time; It is well made, very comfortable on both sides and has better softness and wrinkle resistance Sleep Better: This soft blanket makes you feel like a baby again. When you hold this soft and warm blanket, it feels weighted. When you are laying down, it does not feel too heavy, it adds just enough weight to feel comfortable, warm and snuggled; By giving you the right amount of “weight”, you will sleep better and wake up feeling rested with it; It also keeps everything in place and helps make you feel protected because of the weight Choose Your Right Size: 15 lbs is designed for weight around 100~150 lbs; 20 lbs is designed for weight over 150lbs. If you are an adult over 100 lbs, we would recommend only one person using at a time; So if you're a couple looking, plan on using your own. It might take 2-7 days for you to get use to this blanket; You will get used to the weight eventually; Once you get used to the weight, you will feel great Perfect Gift: If your are a first time buyer, you will certainly be impressed with this blanket. You will like wrapping yourself up when you go to bed, lying on couch; You will love how plush it is too; It will keep everyone warm for the winter and is great for really cold nights. This comfy weighted blanket is a good choice for Thanksgiving, Weddings, New Year, Xmas, Mother's/Father's Day; This plush blanket is also a perfect gift to your lovers, families, friends or a treat to yourself Clean Instructions: Dry wash or spot clean are recommended. If you want to use a washer, please do remember that it needs to be laundered in a commercial washing machine as can be expected since it is too heavy","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XGZhmwqYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zareas","source_asin":"B08BRB93X4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BRB93X4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BRB93X4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
