window.products.push({"id":516871,"name":"BRUGO 2nd Generation Leakproof Travel Mug with Built-in Temperature Control Chamber, Mist Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jmfgB7EVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brugo is 100-Percent leak-proof and full of extra features to become a perfect partner to a perfect brew. Every freshly brewed coffee has what is known as the PTZ, the Perfect Temperature Zone. It's that elusive and very limited window of opportunity between scalding and too cold (hence all the half-drunk mugs of coffee abandoned across the world's office desks). Using thermodynamic technology BRUGO's tip and cool action extends this window to the very last sip. The patented, thermodynamic science of BRUGO gives you the power to immediately enjoy the most vibrant flavor at the perfect drinking temperature. You can drink your tea or coffee without burning your mouth immediately. yes. no more waiting 20 minutes anymore. It's so simple to use, just. Tip and cool or sip. Plus, BRUGO's elegant design and sleek chrome accents will emphasize your discriminating taste. With BRUGO by your side, you will never again have to wait before you can drink your tea and coffee. Now that's more than lip service-it's our promise. Choose from three control options-Lock-so it's sealed and leak-proof,-Tip and Cool-where the temperature control chamber is activated allowing you to enjoy your java at its PTZ, whilst the remaining tea or coffee stays at its hottest and most aromatic and-Sip-for when you want to use it as a traditional mug. Ingenious.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jmfgB7EVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brugo","source_asin":"B004CJ7U6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004CJ7U6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004CJ7U6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":516872,"name":"VonShef Professional 250 Watt Hand Mixer – Includes - 2x Beaters, 2x Dough Hooks and a Balloon Whisk + 5 Speed With Turbo Button","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BKT0E32mL._AC_.jpg","description":"VonShef Black Hand Whisk This is the ultimate kitchen appliance if you love baking and cooking. Our VonShef Hand Whisk offers functionality at your fingertips! With an impressive 250W motor and turbo setting you can effortlessly whisk, mix and knead effortless to bake and cook. The speed settings are all thumb operated, meaning the device is super easy and convenient to use. 5 Components Our VonShef Hand Whisk comes with 5 impressive components that allow you to do a variety of cooking techniques at great ease and convenience. The durable chrome dough hooks make mixing dough and heavier cake mixes easy. The chrome beaters are perfect for whisking egg whites, creaming ingredients and for light cake mixtures or batters. 5 Speed Settings Five impressive speed settings and turbo setting allows you to achieve high quality results from your VonShef Hand Whisk as you can select what speed suits your ingredients. For whipping cream and egg whites our speed five would be great whilst a slower speed would suit stirring gravies and mashing vegetables. With five speeds plus a turbo boost this mixer allows you to adjust the power as required - from the lightest soufflés to the toughest of dough mixtures this is the mixer your kitchen deserves! Not only does it do the job but the VonShef Hand Whisk is stylish too; stunning and sleek black and silver design. The VonShef Hand Whisk also benefits from a compact and light weight design that allows you transport it easily. All of the accessories included with the hand mixer are all dishwasher safe and easy to clean, leaving you more time to bake and less time scrubbing. Includes: • 2x Beaters • 2x Dough Hooks • 1x Balloon Whisk • 1x Electric Hand Whisk - 5 Cable length 5 feet Specifications Wattage - 250W Dimensions - 7.2 x 4.3 x 3 inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BKT0E32mL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VonShef","source_asin":"B00NINA5U6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516872","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NINA5U6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NINA5U6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
