window.products.push({"id":516947,"name":"Doopro Cheese Knife Set, Halloween Gift Cheese Knives 6-Pieces Stainless Steel Cheese Knife Collection with Cheese Slicer and Cheese Cutters (Ceramic ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SonVGJ1pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-class Cheese Knives Set: This Cheese Knife Collection includes 4 cheese knives, 1 cheese fork and 1 cheese spreader, you can slice all types of cheese with our cheese knives set. The attractive ceramic handle and stainless steel blade offers you a high quality cheese knife. Elegant Design and Widely Use: The ceramic craft makes good size and rounded handle attractive and comfortable when you using them.And the stainless steel blade sharp enough on the edge perfect to cut, slice, serve, shave, Suitable for almost all kinds of hard and soft cheese. Easy to clean: Our cheese knife set is easy to clean, only need to rinse with water and wipe with a soft cloth.And we advise that you wash and dry them by hand rather than using a dishwasher. Because the cheese knife blade is a little shape, if hits with other metal, it will cause scratches. Impress Your Guest: Show off your beautiful set of attractive ceramic handle cheese knives set at your next wine-tasting, potluck or backyard BBQ.Showing you have a good taste and they will be the new crowd favorites for any gathering. Perfect Gift for Any Occasion:Who doesn’t love cheese? Our doopro Cheese Knives set comes delivered to your door in our elegantly designed gift-box package and ready for any occasion such a wedding, bridal shower, housewarming or a just-because present! Mother's Day Gift!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SonVGJ1pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Doopro","source_asin":"B08MWC1KHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-516947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MWC1KHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MWC1KHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
